The registry schema follows the shape of the AI Cut OFX Registry
(https://github.com/heshengtao/ai-cut-ofx-registry), which in turn was inspired
by the Open Audio Stack Registry
(https://github.com/open-audio-stack/open-audio-stack-registry). Both are
CC0-1.0.

Candidate metadata may be drafted from the Musical Artifacts catalogue
(https://musical-artifacts.com/). Musical Artifacts aggregates third-party
artefacts; its licence codes are placeholders here and are always replaced by a
reviewed, real licence before an entry is merged.

This repository contains metadata only. It does not contain third-party `.sf2`
or `.sf3` data, cover art, samples, or screenshots. Each bank declares its own
licence in its entry; that licence governs the bank, not this JSON.

